{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In This Next Fest Demo:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This latest demo features all of Chapter 1: The Badwoods. Meet player characters Emmer and Tippleton, explore a lush and dangerous autumnal forest, and recruit the first (ex) boss to your party! Demo playtime is estimated to be 30 minutes to an hour.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>In The Full Game:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Emmer Edette, a cheerful and carefree child who discovers she inherited her famous father's ability to 'save' moments in time at specific points worldwide.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside her grumpy dragon toy sidekick, Tippleton, she embarks on a journey to overwrite all of the world\u2019s save points (\u201cSave Stops\u201d) and confront her father, a once-great Hero using his power for nefarious means.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore six vibrant lands, recruit the Hero\u2019s former foes, and save the world from an untimely end! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A quest that begins at the end</strong> \u2013 Step into a world forever changed by a legendary Hero. Travel across six distinct lands, reclaim corrupted \u201cSave Stops,\u201d and uncover the truth behind your father\u2019s downfall before he brings everything to ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/921c345ac8470adc20e03fd37d4db1df.poster.avif?t=1760461403\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/921c345ac8470adc20e03fd37d4db1df.webm?t=1760461403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/921c345ac8470adc20e03fd37d4db1df.mp4?t=1760461403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join forces with boss allies\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Eager to confront the Hero that once defeated them, five ex-bosses will join you on your adventure\u2014these former formidable foes have uniquely powerful abilities and action costs inspired by traditional RPG boss battles.  Discover their motivations, combine their skills in battle, and see how old enemies can become indispensable friends.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/6838bac48e5706f9a4679f6d7c7b79cc.poster.avif?t=1760461403\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/6838bac48e5706f9a4679f6d7c7b79cc.webm?t=1760461403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/6838bac48e5706f9a4679f6d7c7b79cc.mp4?t=1760461403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel art worlds full of character and challenge</strong> \u2013 Explore beautifully animated pixel art worlds, from the shadowy Badwoods to the mechanical marvel of the airship Aertemis. Each setting is packed with puzzles, enemies, and secrets tailored to its unique atmosphere.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/d44461862f41ad39f434f1969800d1a8.poster.avif?t=1760461403\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/d44461862f41ad39f434f1969800d1a8.webm?t=1760461403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/d44461862f41ad39f434f1969800d1a8.mp4?t=1760461403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets and surprises around every corner</strong> \u2013 Venture off the main path to play minigames, uncover hidden lore, and earn powerful equipment. Every discovery adds more depth to Emmer\u2019s journey and rewards those who take time to explore.    <br> \u00a0 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/49fa3ee9a978a62d8d883580907d6749.poster.avif?t=1760461403\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/49fa3ee9a978a62d8d883580907d6749.webm?t=1760461403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/49fa3ee9a978a62d8d883580907d6749.mp4?t=1760461403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy 30+ original tracks\u00a0</strong>\u2013 A warm and nostalgic original soundtrack composed by Dale &quot;Corgi King&quot; North accompanies your journey   <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/bd9055c367134003cea69c0fb151ee17.poster.avif?t=1760461403\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/bd9055c367134003cea69c0fb151ee17.webm?t=1760461403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/bd9055c367134003cea69c0fb151ee17.mp4?t=1760461403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1553590?t=1760461403","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1553590?t=1760461403","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/bb29644936088d96457c926386423815a8944261/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760461403","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/bb29644936088d96457c926386423815a8944261/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760461403","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4009400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In This Next Fest Demo:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This latest demo features all of Chapter 1: The Badwoods. Meet player characters Emmer and Tippleton, explore a lush and dangerous autumnal forest, and recruit the first (ex) boss to your party! Demo playtime is estimated to be 30 minutes to an hour.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>In The Full Game:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Emmer Edette, a cheerful and carefree child who discovers she inherited her famous father's ability to 'save' moments in time at specific points worldwide.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside her grumpy dragon toy sidekick, Tippleton, she embarks on a journey to overwrite all of the world\u2019s save points (\u201cSave Stops\u201d) and confront her father, a once-great Hero using his power for nefarious means.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore six vibrant lands, recruit the Hero\u2019s former foes, and save the world from an untimely end! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A quest that begins at the end</strong> \u2013 Step into a world forever changed by a legendary Hero. Travel across six distinct lands, reclaim corrupted \u201cSave Stops,\u201d and uncover the truth behind your father\u2019s downfall before he brings everything to ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/921c345ac8470adc20e03fd37d4db1df.poster.avif?t=1760461403\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/921c345ac8470adc20e03fd37d4db1df.webm?t=1760461403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/921c345ac8470adc20e03fd37d4db1df.mp4?t=1760461403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join forces with boss allies\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Eager to confront the Hero that once defeated them, five ex-bosses will join you on your adventure\u2014these former formidable foes have uniquely powerful abilities and action costs inspired by traditional RPG boss battles.  Discover their motivations, combine their skills in battle, and see how old enemies can become indispensable friends.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/6838bac48e5706f9a4679f6d7c7b79cc.poster.avif?t=1760461403\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/6838bac48e5706f9a4679f6d7c7b79cc.webm?t=1760461403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/6838bac48e5706f9a4679f6d7c7b79cc.mp4?t=1760461403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel art worlds full of character and challenge</strong> \u2013 Explore beautifully animated pixel art worlds, from the shadowy Badwoods to the mechanical marvel of the airship Aertemis. Each setting is packed with puzzles, enemies, and secrets tailored to its unique atmosphere.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/d44461862f41ad39f434f1969800d1a8.poster.avif?t=1760461403\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/d44461862f41ad39f434f1969800d1a8.webm?t=1760461403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/d44461862f41ad39f434f1969800d1a8.mp4?t=1760461403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets and surprises around every corner</strong> \u2013 Venture off the main path to play minigames, uncover hidden lore, and earn powerful equipment. Every discovery adds more depth to Emmer\u2019s journey and rewards those who take time to explore.    <br> \u00a0 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/49fa3ee9a978a62d8d883580907d6749.poster.avif?t=1760461403\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/49fa3ee9a978a62d8d883580907d6749.webm?t=1760461403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/49fa3ee9a978a62d8d883580907d6749.mp4?t=1760461403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy 30+ original tracks\u00a0</strong>\u2013 A warm and nostalgic original soundtrack composed by Dale &quot;Corgi King&quot; North accompanies your journey   <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/bd9055c367134003cea69c0fb151ee17.poster.avif?t=1760461403\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/bd9055c367134003cea69c0fb151ee17.webm?t=1760461403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/extras/bd9055c367134003cea69c0fb151ee17.mp4?t=1760461403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p>","developers":["Paper Sword Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1553590/1b8083254155a2267116b21820d3ad3a93c6ccb9/header.jpg?t=1760461403","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1553590/736791/391c46a8aa89c19fb0067176818eb733058685a5/1751002388/dash_av1.mpd?t=1723040757","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1553590/736791/391c46a8aa89c19fb0067176818eb733058685a5/1751002388/dash_h264.mpd?t=1723040757","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1553590/736791/391c46a8aa89c19fb0067176818eb733058685a5/1751002388/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1723040757","id":257044091,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257044091/movie480.mp4?t=1723040757","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257044091/movie_max.mp4?t=1